{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 120,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are going to be unemployed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1920,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are never getting a job."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3840,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I applied to 647 roles\nbefore I got one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7920,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of my friends had an AI interview."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10560,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The AI did the interviewing.?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12000,
    "dDurationMs": 360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12360,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Someone tell me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13720,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Someone tell me and explain to me\nwhat is going on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17800,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the job market recently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19440,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, okay, I'll do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21760,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As you've just seen, to a lot of\nespecially young people,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24560,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it feels like it's really difficult\nto get a job right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28480,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29160,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Officially,\nthe economy is still doing quite"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31920,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fine and stock\nmarkets are certainly super high."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35720,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what's going on?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37320,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why is it so difficult\nto get a job right now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40240,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "According to a large share of bosses,\nthe reason is simple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44000,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most tasks carried out by entry level\ncolleagues could be performed by a AI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49760,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But is that really true?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51240,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is the job market really that bad?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53160,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it especially bad for young people?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55080,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And most importantly, is it bad because of\nAI or are bosses just saying that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60560,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it's much less politically risky\nthan blaming Donald Trump's trade war?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65920,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or it's easier than admitting that they\nhired too many people during the pandemic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70880,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the question economists have been\ndoing a ton of in-depth research about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75040,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And yes, as always\nhere on Money and Macro,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we will spare you\nthe need to read all of that yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81240,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we have summarized\nthe three most important explanations for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85560,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this phenomenon in this video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87640,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But before getting into exactly\nwhat they are, let's have a quick"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91080,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "look at the data.\nAre these TikTokers right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94640,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it actually difficult\nto get a job right now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97560,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The most obvious place to look\nfirst is the unemployment rate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101320,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is, the percentage of working age\npeople actively looking for a job,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105400,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but who cannot find one right now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108120,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the US, we can clearly see that\nindeed, unemployment has been rising"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112200,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "since the summer of 2022\nfrom about 3.5% to 4.3%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117600,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Meanwhile, in big European economies\nlike the UK, Germany,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120680,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where a job market crisis has also been\nin the news a lot, we can also see that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124640,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "unemployment is already heading back\ntowards levels only seen in the pandemic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129680,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what's really striking,\nthough, about the labor market today"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132720,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that we have seen that despite\nsome really spectacular layoffs at high"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136800,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "profile companies,\nand the rise in unemployment really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140000,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "does not seem to be driven\nby so many more layoffs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143600,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but rather by a quite spectacular\nfall in new job postings by companies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149640,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As we can see here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150840,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That trend holds for the US,\nbut also for the UK and Germany."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155280,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, if we look at whether or not\nyoung people in particular"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158840,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are hit the hardest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160120,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can see that in all three countries,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161880,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "youth unemployment is quite a bit higher\nthan regular unemployment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165960,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if we look at how much it's risen\nsince 2022, we can see that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170560,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "only in the UK has the youth unemployment\nreally risen much faster."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175200,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Germany, It's pretty close\nto regular unemployment, and in the US,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179320,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "young workers have actually still done\nbetter than average since 2022."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183920,
    "dDurationMs": 760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's kind of strange,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184680,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "given that AI was supposed to have taken\nso many entry level jobs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189000,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there's clearly more going on here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191160,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, we've identified three\nmajor trends"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194120,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that can help explain\nwhy you can't find a job anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197360,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, AI is still a factor,\nbut it's more subtle than you think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200880,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's get into it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202360,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's how the rise of AI\nis actually impacting the job market."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207280,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One thing is for sure,\nmany businesses are already using AI"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211520,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and many more are planning\nto introduce it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213960,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Germany, for example,\nabout 27% of firms are actively using AI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218800,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another 80% is planning to use it\nand 34% is actively discussing it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223800,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And only about 21%\nthink it's not relevant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227280,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are very impressive numbers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229240,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just to illustrate how spectacular\nAI adoption percentages are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233040,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Have a look at this graph comparing\npersonal AI adoption to people adopting,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237440,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for example, personal computers\nin the 1980s or the internet in the 1990s."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242200,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This means that AI is the most rapidly\nadopted technology in human history."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247800,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think about that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248840,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So actually, it would be quite straight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250600,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if we did not see any effect at all\nin the labor market."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254880,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But just because businesses are using AI,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257240,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that by itself\ndoes not mean that it's costing jobs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260040,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After all, companies\ncould be using AI to replace people,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263080,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they could also be using it\nto make existing workers more productive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266920,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To find out\nwhether AI is getting people fired"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269240,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or not hired, at least, Stanford\neconomists Erik Brynjolfsson, Bharat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274640,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Chander and Raju Chen studied\nsuper detailed payroll data"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279720,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from occupations\nthat were especially exposed to new"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282720,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AI models like software developers\nand customer service."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287040,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As you can see here, early career software\ndevelopers who tended to support"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291520,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "older coders by doing simple tasks\nrapidly, disappeared from companies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296160,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after the launch of ChatGPT\nindicated by the vertical line."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300320,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, more experienced coders\nkept being hired."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303680,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as you can see here, the same trend\ncan be seen in customer services."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307880,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After GPT, young people disappeared\nfrom customer service centers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311880,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at a rapid pace\nwhile more experienced workers remained."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315800,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Meanwhile,\nyoung people in less exposed jobs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318280,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like stock clerks\nworking in warehouses and health aides"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322680,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "did not see this\nmassive drop in employment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326320,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is some pretty solid evidence\nthat AI is absolutely impacting jobs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332160,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but only in certain sectors\nand in these sectors,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335520,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's the young,\nless experienced people that are indeed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338560,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hurt more\nthan their more experienced colleagues."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341920,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But of course, just looking at one\nstudy is not enough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344840,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another really interesting study was done\nby economists Hui, Reshef and Zhou."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350480,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Rather than looking at workers,\nthey looked at freelancer jobs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354080,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "posted on the popular jobs\nmarket website Upwork."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357520,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Specifically,\nthey studied two distinct AI waves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361160,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, they research\nhow text based AI models like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363880,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "GPT affected writing based freelance jobs\nlike copywriters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368200,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And after that, they looked at\nhow image models like Midjourney and DALL"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372080,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "E affected the freelance job market\nfor graphic designers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376440,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, interestingly,\nthey found a clear impact"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379560,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before the introduction of these models,\nwhich is the black vertical line, again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383880,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "exposed and non-expert."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385120,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those jobs had a stable relation\ncompared to each other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388680,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then after AI, there is a clear trend\nshowing the number of jobs were exposed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393080,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jobs declined rapidly\ncompared to these non exposed jobs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397880,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Combining these two studies,\nI think there's clear evidence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400920,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that AI is already leading\nto some job losses where, given that it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405120,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mostly affects less experienced people,\nthis could indeed show up as less hiring,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409640,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "making it more difficult to find a job,\nespecially for young people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413280,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Unless AI is creating more jobs\nthan it is destroying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417400,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After all, in the past, new technologies\nhave obliterated specific jobs very often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422760,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But soon after, new jobs\nappeared to replace them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426280,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, the invention"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427320,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the printing press\ndecimated the jobs market for scribes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431720,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But at the same time it created"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432960,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "jobs like book\nbinding, publishing, and book selling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436120,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The invention of digital technologies\nruined the job market for switchboard"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439760,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "operators, or so-called human computers,\nwho did complex calculations by hand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444840,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But over time, it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445640,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "created a lot of new jobs like programmer,\nweb developer, and data scientist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449920,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So is that the case today as well?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451560,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. Probably somewhat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453320,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A recent analysis by researcher\nHenley Wing Chiu"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457080,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the US job market reveals\nthat many of the jobs with the biggest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460840,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "declines were exactly those that\nAI affected the most."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464760,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Computer graphics\nartist, photographer and writer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467920,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the other hand,\nthe US job seeing the most increases"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471280,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "last year was Machine Learning Engineer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474800,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sadly, his analysis\nonly gives us percentages though,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478240,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it does not tell us\nexactly how many jobs were lost"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481520,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that we cannot compare them to jobs\ngained."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483800,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact,\nI couldn't find any good research on this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486720,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but if I had to put my money on it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488320,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I bet that we are seeing both effects\nof AI right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is making some workers more productive,\nbut on average"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is also costing more jobs\nthan it is creating."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498720,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I think so far this effect is limited"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501120,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to sectors\nlike graphic design and writing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504040,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, as you can see in this graph\nby the Economic Innovation group,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507440,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "unemployment for jobs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508480,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are super exposed to AI like\nthe orange and blue lines is rising."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Absolutely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514000,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But actually unemployment in less exposed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516640,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "jobs like the green and yellow lines\nis rising as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521000,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I cannot fully explain\nwhy you cannot find a job right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525640,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To truly get to the bottom of why\nit's so difficult to find a job right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529600,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We need to talk about a second\nmajor global development."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533600,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But first, we need to talk about something\nelse that's happening behind the scenes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537840,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because just like the job market,\na lot of systems we rely on every day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 542120,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are changing in ways\nmost people do not notice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545120,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "including the networks\nthat run our phones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 548960,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That brings us to today's sponsor, Cape."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551840,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "America's\nonly privacy first mobile carrier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555280,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you are uncomfortable with big carriers\nlike AT\u0026T, Verizon, and T-Mobile"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560200,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "engaging in opaque data selling practices,\nthen you'll be happy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564280,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to know that there's now\nfinally a true privacy first alternative."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568400,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cape."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568960,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cape is built up from the ground\nfor privacy and security."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure, you can use a VPN or encrypted\nmessenger app,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576600,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you'd always be vulnerable\nat the network level."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580000,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cape fixes that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581440,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Unlike traditional carriers,\nCape does not ask for your name,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585480,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "address, or even Social Security number\nwhen you sign up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589480,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It collects really the bare\nminimum and automatically deletes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593040,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what it does collect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594680,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cape also protects against SIM swaps"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597480,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by using a 24 word private key\nthat only you control."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601080,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No customer service agent can move\nyour number without it, and it's enhanced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605720,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Signaling protection blocks\nthe kind of network level of text"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609120,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that can reveal your location or intercept\nyour calls."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 612800,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cape is not just another reseller either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615360,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a heavy MVNO,\nwhich means it owns and operates its own"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619960,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mobile core, giving it total control\nover the data which it gets collected"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624120,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and which does not, how it's secured\nand who can access it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 627880,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's something no other privacy\nfocused carrier in the US does."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631800,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you're tired of being the product\nand you actually want a carrier"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635240,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that keeps your data private, check out\nCape through my link at Cape.co/moneymacro"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640800,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and use my code MANDM33"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643800,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get 33% off\nyour first six months of Cape, or use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648720,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the link in the description to learn more\nand start protecting your phone today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652640,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That said, let's get back to explanation\nnumber two"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656440,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "massive policy uncertainty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658880,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course,\nthis reason is mostly about one man."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663200,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you everybody, and thank you\nto the media, the media has been terrific."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666560,
    "dDurationMs": 760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Believe it or not,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668320,
    "dDurationMs": 760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn’t use- see?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669080,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn’t use the words fake news one time.\nThat's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671880,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mr. Trump and his trade war"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673640,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so far has really been characterized\nby chaos and uncertainty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678200,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Have a look at this fascinating graph\nby the Financial Times."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681080,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It shows that on average, Trump's proposed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 683920,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tariffs have been going up and down\nlike crazy over the year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688080,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Meanwhile,\nactual tariffs have slowly followed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 691240,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But crucially, businesses\ndid not know that in advance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 695240,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's well known that when governments\nswing between aggressive and unpredictable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699120,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "policies, affected businesses\nfreeze, firms delay hiring, postpone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704360,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "investments and wait to see what rules\nthey'll be operating under next."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708360,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And yes, we can actually see in the data"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710560,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that uncertainty is unusually high\nthese days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714320,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The so-called policy\nuncertainty index has exploded"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 717840,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over the past year in both Europe\nand the United States, coinciding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722040,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with Donald Trump\ntaking office in January 2025."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726080,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Could this explain\nwhy companies are not hiring anymore?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729560,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All around the world, former economics\nNobel Prize winner Paul Krugman argues"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735000,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that Trump's wildly erratic policies\nare in fact creating huge uncertainty,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739800,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is deterring many companies\nfrom hiring workers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 743280,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His main piece of evidence for this\nis that the number of long term unemployed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747360,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has really surged since Liberation Day,\nthe moment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 750520,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Trump announced his most dramatic tariff\nchanges."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753840,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second piece of evidence concerns\nBlack workers whose unemployment rate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 758320,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has also climbed sharply\nafter Liberation Day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762280,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Historically, Black workers are among"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764280,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the first to be laid off\nand the last to be rehired in the US."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768560,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So rising uncertainty there is really\na signal of broader problems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773920,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Trump policies have wider impact\nthat go beyond U.S."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 777120,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "borders as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 778360,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, Germany's Ifo institute\nestimates that German manufacturing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 782440,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could shrink by about 2.8%\nbecause of them, with the automobile"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 787400,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and pharmaceutical industries\ntaking the hardest hits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 790400,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Germany's uncertainty\ndoesn't come from Trump alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793200,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It comes from China as well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794960,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where a massive industrial rise is hitting\nGerman industry especially hard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799040,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the less exposed countries, jobs don't\nseem to be under as much pressure yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804240,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Netherlands, France, Spain\nand all of these countries,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 807440,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AI is playing a major role,\nbut there's less uncertainty,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810960,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this could explain\nwhy unemployment is not yet rising"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814400,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as much in these countries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 815920,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Meanwhile, the UK is also less\nexposed to the trade war,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819320,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but their businesses have indicated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821440,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they are mostly concerned\nabout uncertainty from its own government"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825480,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is, struggling to provide clarity\non how much it will raise taxes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830160,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how much it will increase the minimum wage\nand increase"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 832800,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the national insurance contributions\nthat these firms have to pay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 836160,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, whether it's about the US, China\nor UK uncertainty, there's one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 840720,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "big problem with the uncertainty\nexplanation in general; the timing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 844920,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If we look at the falling hiring\ntrend over a couple of years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 848080,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it just doesn't match up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849560,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jobs are decreasing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 850560,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ever since 2022, and in turn\nthey only really became extreme in 2025."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855360,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Therefore, to fully understand\nwhy it's so difficult to find a job"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858440,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right now, we need to talk\nabout our final explanation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862080,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is the unwinding\nof the Covid economy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 867000,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see, one thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 868040,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I’m missing\nin the current media landscape,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870160,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that I hope to address\nwith this channel,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 872040,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that a truly long term\nmacroeconomic perspective."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875760,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, as we have seen,\nunemployment is rising."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 878760,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what happens\nif we zoom out a couple of decades?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882600,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then you get this picture in the US,\nyou get this picture in the UK"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 887520,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you get this picture in Germany."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890160,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, if we draw a line on these graphs,\nwe can see that unemployment is still well"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895000,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "under- or maybe in the case of the UK,\nnear to its long term historical average."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 900960,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On top of that,\ntwo things really stand out to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903240,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I look at these pictures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 904600,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first is that unemployment\ncomes and goes in cycles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 908040,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the second is that unemployment\nwas really exceptionally low"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912600,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right before and after Covid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914480,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was the period\nof the Great resignation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 917000,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where jobs were so available\nthat people were able to leave"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 920640,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "abusive bosses and underpaid jobs\nand move to better paid positions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 925560,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That actually sounds like the way the job\nmarket should always be, doesn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 929120,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what ended this period?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 931320,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, I think the most plausible\nexplanation is the end"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934240,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of high government\nstimulus and ultra low interest rates."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 937560,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Governments are now worried again\nabout that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 939640,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And central banks\nhave increased interest rates."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 942760,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As a result, less money is circulating\nin most economies and as a result of that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 947760,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there just now aren't as many jobs\nas there used to be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951840,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So to get back to our original question,\nis it really that difficult to find a job"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 956880,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right now, especially for young people,\nlike we're seeing in these TikToks?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 960720,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, absolutely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 962040,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At least when you compare it\nto just three years ago, this can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966320,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "partially be explained by AI sure,\nand some geopolitical uncertainty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 970520,
    "dDurationMs": 760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 971280,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But historically speaking, sadly,\nit looks like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973880,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what we've seen so far\nis really simply an return to normality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 978200,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That can be explained almost completely\nby the end of Covid stimulus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982080,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So will this situation get better\nor worse?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984360,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, we can never know for sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 986040,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the optimistic side,\nwe have seen in the past that technologies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 988920,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have actually created more jobs,\nSometimes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 991720,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It took time for these to develop though,\nso I do think there is good reason"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 995560,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be hopeful that we haven't seen some of\nthese more subtle benefits of AI yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000680,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But honestly, my expectation\nis that geopolitical"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1003960,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "uncertainty will only get worse\nas we enter a multipolar world order."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1007760,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On top of that, AI adoption will likely\nfirst lead to more job losses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1011840,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with government debt\nso high and societies quickly aging,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015200,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I certainly think it's unlikely\nwe will see more government"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1018760,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stimulus on the level\nas we saw during Covid again soon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022640,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think it's unlikely that\nthe job market will get much better soon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1026280,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But yeah, what do you think?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028040,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me know in the comments below."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1029240,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you are already making privacy\na priority in your life, consider"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1032960,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going the extra mile by checking out\nour sponsor Cape using the link below."
    } ]
  } ]
}
